.SH NAME
usbradioplus-migration \- targeted Rust host migration checks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cargo test --offline --locked -p usbradioplus-core --lib
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run targeted checks in the container described by
.I .hybrid/workflows.json
using the maintained project-owned, labeled container launcher.
.PP
The migration plan and acceptance criteria are in .hybrid/migration.md.
This developer workflow does not approve deployment or replace the full PR gate.
.SH OPTIONS
.B --offline --locked
Use the dependency cache and exact Cargo.lock resolution.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B cargo fmt --all -- --check
.PP
Run the command inside the selected image without rewriting source.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero means the selected check passed. Nonzero requires diagnosis.
